    <body>
      <div type="clause">
        <head>Cn 1018</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And se ðe unlaga arære. oððe undom deme heonan forð. for læððe. oððe feohfange. beo se wið þone cyngc. cxx. scillinga scildig. buton he geladige. þæt he na bet ne cuðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And from now on he who promotes injustice or makes unjust judgments, either from hate or for profit, shall forfeit 120 shillings to the king, unless he provides an oath that he knew no better.</ab>
      </div>
